1
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,760
(Sheldon:)Damn you, WalletNook.com.

2
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,764
(Leonard:)Problem?

3
00:00:15,932 --> 00:00:18,222
(Sheldon:)The online description
was completely misleading.

4
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:20,853
(Sheldon:)They said eight slots plus removable ID.

5
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:23,941
(Sheldon:)To any rational person,
that would mean room for nine cards.

6
00:00:24,107 --> 00:00:26,947
(Sheldon:)But they don't tell you,
the removable ID takes up one slot.

7
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:29,030
(Sheldon:)It's a nightmare.

8
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:31,194
(Leonard:)Okay, now, do you really need...

9
00:00:31,364 --> 00:00:34,954
(Leonard:)...the honorary Justice League
of America membership card?

10
00:00:35,452 --> 00:00:38,622
(Sheldon:)It's been in every wallet
I've owned since I was 5.

11
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:40,294
(Leonard:)Why?

12
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:43,627
It says, "Keep this on your person
at all times."

13
00:00:43,793 --> 00:00:44,833
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

14
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,923
(Sheldon:)It's right here, under Batman's signature.

15
00:00:48,506 --> 00:00:52,136
(Raj:)And this is Leonard
and Sheldon's apartment.

16
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:54,892
[CHUCKLES]
Guess whose parents just got broadband.

17
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:58,975
Leonard, may I present, live from New Delhi,
Dr. and Mrs. V. M. Koothrappali?

18
00:00:59,142 --> 00:01:00,182
(Leonard:)Hi.

19
00:01:00,351 --> 00:01:02,811
Tilt up the camera.
I'm looking at his crotch.

